It resolves #2298.

As custom tickers(ex: Item_NT_111) was created, transferAsset action should be able to accept custom ticker instead of pre-defined enum currency.

changed schema looks like... :

```gql
actionQuery {
  transferAsset{
    sender: "0x00",
    recipient: "0x01",
    value: {
      ticker: "token_str",
      decimalPlaces: 18,
      minters: [],
      quantity: 100
    }
  }
}
```

